s1grep is licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

It runs ONNX Runtime by Microsoft: built into the Linux binary, and onnxruntime.dll next to s1grep.exe on Windows
(MIT licence; see licenses/onnxruntime-LICENSE.txt and licenses/onnxruntime-ThirdPartyNotices.txt).

The models are not included; `s1grep setup` downloads them from Hugging Face:
- s1-code v3 (api-service-sac/s1-code-v3), Apache 2.0, fine-tuned from Laya by Convai Innovations (Apache 2.0).
- granite-embedding-278m-multilingual in ONNX (api-service-sac/granite-embedding-278m-multilingual-onnx),
  Apache 2.0, by IBM, exported without changing its weights.
